# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type }})

The `portainer_team` data source allows you to look up an existing Portainer team by its name.

## Example Usage

### Look up a team by name

```hcl
data "portainer_team" "developers" {
  name = "Developers"
}

output "team_id" {
  value = data.portainer_team.developers.id
}
```

